    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Understanding the Concept of Nursing and the Nursing Process is fundamental for patient care.",
        "Monitoring Vital Signs, including body temperature measurement and identification of pulse sites, is critical.",
        "Adhering to Infection Control and understanding Types of Isolation Precautions prevents hospital-acquired infections.",
        "Key nursing interventions include managing Patient Positions, Bed Making, Personal Hygiene Care, and Patient Safety Measures."
      ],
      "id": "0vs821z"
